//! The ruleset's ban lists as param ids, generated by `scripts/er-duel-rules-gen.py` from
//! the installed game. Do not edit: rerun `python3 scripts/er-duel-rules-gen.py --write`.
//!
//! Every row keeps the name it was reached from, so this file is also the list to read when
//! checking what the DLL will report.

